{"id": "amb2-meta-01", "surface": "jan pali jan pali jan pali jan", "rationale": "Seven tokens hold two overlapping maximal runs: (jan pali) x3 at 0-5 leaves a trailing jan, (pali jan) x3 at 1-6 leaves a leading jan. Neither folds a superset of the other, so both stay (ambiguity is a value, SPEC 2.8). Longer analogue of m12.", "source_rule": "SPEC 7; canon/04 5; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "AMBIGUOUS", "expect_skeletons": ["{D2(jan pali) jan}", "{jan D2(pali jan)}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 2, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"depth": 2, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-02", "surface": "jan pali jan pali jan li awen", "rationale": "The overlap of m12 survives inside a subject: the fold choice does not interact with the li boundary, so both subjects are offered.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "AMBIGUOUS", "expect_skeletons": ["({D1(jan pali) jan} li {awen})", "({jan D1(pali jan)} li {awen})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-03", "surface": "jan pali pali jan", "rationale": "The only fold, pali pali -> D1(pali), leaves three units (jan D1(pali) jan) without pi; unfolded it is four units. META never rescues a three-unit concept (invariant 14).", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-04", "surface": "ilo ilo ilo sitelen", "rationale": "n consecutive copies form one unit D^(n-1): three ilo are D2(ilo), not D1(ilo) followed by ilo. Only the maximal run is a META unit.", "source_rule": "SPEC 7; canon/04 5; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{D2(ilo) sitelen}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 2, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "sitelen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-05", "surface": "ilo pali ilo pali pali", "rationale": "Two fold candidates exist (ilo pali x2; pali pali) but folding pali pali leaves four units; only the first yields a valid phrase, so the statement stays RESOLVED (cf. m11).", "source_rule": "SPEC 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{D1(ilo pali) pali}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-06", "surface": "jan jan pali pali", "rationale": "Two independent folds give two units, a valid two-unit head; any partial fold leaves three units.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.2, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{D1(jan) D1(pali)}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}]}, {"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-07", "surface": "ilo pi sona lawa sona lawa", "rationale": "A fold counts as ONE unit, so folding sona lawa sona lawa leaves a pi group of one unit; unfolded, the group takes sona lawa and two units remain. META cannot manufacture the required pair.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-08", "surface": "jan pi ilo ilo sona sona", "rationale": "Nested-looking repetition inside a pi group: both repeats fold, each fold is one unit, and the group is exactly the two folded units.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan pi D1(ilo) D1(sona)}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}]}, "right": {"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}]}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-09", "surface": "jan pi ilo ilo", "rationale": "SPEC says META has priority but does not say what happens when the folded reading is invalid (group of one: jan pi D1(ilo)). Read here as for tan (SPEC 2.11: the lower-priority reading applies where the higher one does not parse): the unfolded group [ilo ilo] stays valid. This is an interpretation, not a quoted rule - flagged for the author. Author decision 2026-10-09 (D3): a META fold applies only where the resulting reading is valid; otherwise the unfolded reading(s) are used.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7 (spec silent on fallback); author decision 2026-10-09 D3 (META fold fallback)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan pi ilo ilo}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-10", "surface": "jan li pali e ilo tan ma tan ma", "rationale": "canon/11 row 5 spells this out: a repeated source phrase folds (META beats the structural reading), so tan ma tan ma is D1(tan ma) inside the object phrase, not two source phrases.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; canon/11 departure 5; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {pali} e {ilo D1(tan ma)})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, {"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "object_list"}, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-meta-11", "surface": "jan li tan tan ma", "rationale": "canon/11 row 5 gives this reading: tan tan folds to D1(tan) (META beats the source-predicate reading li tan {tan ma}), leaving the two-unit phrase D1(tan) ma.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; canon/11 departure 5; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {D1(tan) ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-01", "surface": "jan li ilo tan tan ma", "rationale": "Genuine ambiguity, not manufactured: the first tan may be the vector in head {ilo tan} with the second as source marker, or the second may be the vector in {tan ma} with the first as source marker. Each reading has exactly one structural tan at a different position, so structural-wins (SPEC 2.11) cannot choose. Folding tan tan leaves three units (ilo D1(tan) ma), so META does not apply. Author decision 2026-10-09 (D3): a META fold applies only where the resulting reading is valid; otherwise the unfolded reading(s) are used.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; canon/04 3; author decision 2026-10-09 D3 (META fold fallback)", "expect_status": "AMBIGUOUS", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {ilo tan} tan {ma})", "({jan} li {ilo} tan {tan ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-02", "surface": "jan li tan ma anu kute", "rationale": "Stays RESOLVED by precedence: the vector reading li ({tan ma} anu {kute}) also parses, but a structural source predicate exists and wins, with anu inside the source phrase.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.11, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li tan ({ma} anu {kute}))"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-03", "surface": "tan ma anu kute la jan li pali", "rationale": "Source context with an alternative: the vector subject ({tan ma} anu {kute}) also parses; the structural source context wins.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.11, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(tan ({ma} anu {kute}) la ({jan} li {pali}))"], "expect_asts": [{"body": {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "context": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "source": true, "type": "context"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-04", "surface": "jan li tan ma li tan kute", "rationale": "Two source predicates in a row; the vector reading li {tan ma} li {tan kute} also parses and loses to the structural one on both tan.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.11, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li tan {ma} li tan {kute})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}, {"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-05", "surface": "tan ma la jan li tan kute", "rationale": "Source context and source predicate in one statement; both structural readings win over the all-vector reading.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.11, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(tan {ma} la ({jan} li tan {kute}))"], "expect_asts": [{"body": {"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "context": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "source": true, "type": "context"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-06", "surface": "tan ma tan kute la jan li pali", "rationale": "A source context takes exactly one expression (tan X la S). The vector reading needs the clause tan ma tan kute, which is four units. Two tan phrases before la have no reading.", "source_rule": "canon/04 3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-07", "surface": "jan li tan jan pi ilo sona", "rationale": "Source predicate whose phrase carries a pi group; the vector reading li {tan jan pi ilo sona} also parses, the structural one wins.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.11, 5.3, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li tan {jan pi ilo sona})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-08", "surface": "tan tan la jan li pali", "rationale": "META over structure: tan tan folds to D1(tan) (a one-unit context) instead of source context tan {tan} la ..., as in m06/m18.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18; canon/04 5; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({D1(tan)} la ({jan} li {pali}))"], "expect_asts": [{"body": {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "context": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}, "source": false, "type": "context"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-tan-09", "surface": "jan li pali e ilo tan ma e ijo", "rationale": "Objects come before source phrases, so the structural reading is closed; the vector fallback would need e {ilo tan ma} (three units) or a second object after a two-unit head. Nothing parses: the vector fallback has limits (cf. t10, where it does).", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; canon/11 departure 3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-01", "surface": "jan anu ilo anu ma", "rationale": "expression = phrase [anu expression]: a chain nests to the right, and the left-nested reading does not exist (no AMBIGUOUS).", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; canon/04 3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} anu ({ilo} anu {ma}))"], "expect_asts": [{"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "alternative"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-02", "surface": "jan li pali anu awen anu pini", "rationale": "Right-nested chain in a predicate; as in m15 nothing folds.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li ({pali} anu ({awen} anu {pini})))"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pini", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "alternative"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-03", "surface": "jan anu ilo anu ma anu kute li pali", "rationale": "A four-way alternative in the subject followed by li is fine (anu-then-li concerns predicates only) and stays right-nested.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(({jan} anu ({ilo} anu ({ma} anu {kute}))) li {pali})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-04", "surface": "jan li pali e ilo anu sitelen e linja anu toki", "rationale": "anu binds tighter than e: each object is its own alternative, and the whole predicate containing anu is the last (only) predicate.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {pali} e ({ilo} anu {sitelen}) e ({linja} anu {toki}))"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": {"items": [{"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "sitelen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "linja", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "toki", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}], "type": "object_list"}, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-05", "surface": "jan pi ilo sona anu ma", "rationale": "pi binds tighter than anu: the alternative is between phrase {jan pi ilo sona} and {ma}; anu never enters a pi group.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6 (pi is the tightest); author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan pi ilo sona} anu {ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"left": {"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-06", "surface": "jan li pali anu awen e ilo", "rationale": "Precedence e/tan looser than anu: the head of the predicate is the alternative ({pali} anu {awen}) and e ilo applies to the predicate; e cannot sit inside the alternative.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6 (e looser than anu); author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li ({pali} anu {awen}) e {ilo})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "objects": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "object_list"}, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-07", "surface": "jan anu ilo li pali anu awen", "rationale": "anu in the subject and in the last predicate together; a positive control for the anu-then-li rule.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(({jan} anu {ilo}) li ({pali} anu {awen}))"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-08", "surface": "jan li pali anu awen la ilo li pini", "rationale": "An anu predicate is the last predicate of ITS clause; la then starts a new clause. No clause-level choice is created.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(({jan} li ({pali} anu {awen})) la ({ilo} li {pini}))"], "expect_asts": [{"body": {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pini", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "context": {"predicates": [{"head": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "source": false, "type": "context"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-09", "surface": "jan anu anu ilo", "rationale": "anu joins two phrases; a particle never forms a phrase or a META unit (cf. k14).", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-anu-10", "surface": "ma pali anu ma awen la jan li pali", "rationale": "An alternative in the context position: la is the loosest operator, anu stays inside the context clause.", "source_rule": "SPEC 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["(({ma pali} anu {ma awen}) la ({jan} li {pali}))"], "expect_asts": [{"body": {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, "context": {"left": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "awen", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}, "source": false, "type": "context"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-01", "surface": "jan pi ilo pi sona lawa", "rationale": "pi groups do not nest: pi needs exactly two units after it, and a particle is not a unit.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-02", "surface": "jan pi ilo sona pi lawa kute", "rationale": "Looks like pi inside pi but is two sibling groups of the head jan; there is exactly one tree (extends p10).", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan pi ilo sona pi lawa kute}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}, {"left": {"token": "lawa", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-03", "surface": "jan ilo pi sona lawa pi kute ken", "rationale": "A two-unit head with two groups: the shape is fixed (head of one or two units, then groups of exactly two).", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan ilo pi sona lawa pi kute ken}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "lawa", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}, {"left": {"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "ken", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-04", "surface": "jan pi ilo sona lawa", "rationale": "A pi group of three units is not allowed; the third unit has no place.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-05", "surface": "ilo pi sona lawa anu kute", "rationale": "anu after a pi group closes the group; it does not become part of it.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({ilo pi sona lawa} anu {kute})"], "expect_asts": [{"left": {"groups": [{"left": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "lawa", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-06", "surface": "jan li pali e ilo pi sona lawa pi kute ken tan ma", "rationale": "Two pi groups in an object phrase followed by a source phrase: pi binds tighter than tan.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {pali} e {ilo pi sona lawa pi kute ken} tan {ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "pali", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": {"items": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "lawa", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}, {"left": {"token": "kute", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "ken", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "object_list"}, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-07", "surface": "jan pi ilo sona anu ma pi sona lawa", "rationale": "The second pi attaches to the head ma of the right phrase, not to the left phrase: groups never cross anu.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3, 6; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan pi ilo sona} anu {ma pi sona lawa})"], "expect_asts": [{"left": {"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ilo", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "right": {"groups": [{"left": {"token": "sona", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "lawa", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "alternative"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "amb2-pi-08", "surface": "jan li tan jan pi ilo sona ala", "rationale": "pi group of exactly two units: ilo sona ala is three units after pi; vector tan cannot absorb them either.", "source_rule": "SPEC 5.3; author decision 2026-10-09 (accepted)", "expect_status": "INVALID", "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
